Unova_MistraltonCity_Z108_EventScript_Npc1_Text_0:
	.string "Hee-hee!\nI've been waiting for you.\pDid you enjoy flying with the help of\nthe Mistralton Gym cannons?\pThey're my pride and joy!\pThis time, let's try something else!$"

Unova_MistraltonCity_Z108_EventScript_Npc1_Text_1:
	.string "You're an amazing Pokémon Trainer.\pMy Pokémon and I are happy,\nbecause for the first time in a while,\l\lwe could fight with our full strength.\pThis is an official League Gym Badge.\nI think it will look good on you.$"

Unova_MistraltonCity_Z108_EventScript_Npc1_Text_2:
	.string "{PLAYER} received the\nJet Badge from Skyla.$"

Unova_MistraltonCity_Z108_EventScript_Npc1_Text_3:
	.string "Wow, hot stuff!\pWith that many Gym Badges,\nPokémon up to Lv. 70 will obey you.\pAlso, as thanks for a Pokémon battle\nthat made me very happy,\l\lI want you to have this TM.$"

Unova_MistraltonCity_Z108_EventScript_Npc1_Text_4:
	.string "My present to you is Acrobatics.\nIf the user doesn't have a held item,\l\lits power doubles.\l\lIt's a pretty technical move.\pBe sure to compensate for the\nlack of a held item!\pBy the way, when I flew over\nTwist Mountain on the way\l\lto Icirrus City...\pTeam Plasma--is that the name?\nAnyway, they were heading for the city.\pWhat kind of people are they?$"

